{"catch":"小小國王，巨大挑戰。","desc":"Tiny Crown 是一款節奏明快的像素風平台遊戲。你將帶領一位勇敢的小國王，穿越充滿陷阱、尖刺與危險跳躍的城堡。奔跑、跳躍並努力生存，在精心設計的關卡中考驗你的時機掌握、精準度與耐心。\n別被迷人的復古畫面騙了——每一個房間都是新的挑戰。只要一步失誤，城堡就會毫不留情地懲罰你。但只要擁有技巧、毅力與敏銳的反應，就算是最渺小的統治者，也能征服最致命的地下城。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-09-24","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/76200345d48d0bf5bf09aa797731678c8ba01800024a60ad674895fc75c8b15c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0b5552b48d6392018a176ab3bd77518a91d8742f89e9b8ff54c4f7fd1fe8f7db.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d3ffa64749e41b565346a47b3c31993504fdd5e5af98888acf5e3655ad256dbe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/390cc7438cc39a8ba400de5102e1562c0bd1ce8fe74c2800a19b06aa467708a0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a234cf11ff7e194eda30982c2445467025cdcf5bd60e88312d4ab6c646368f01.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/75456f8352bdda27d089d238c31f622a778dba34a3ef9a4f8139a18802849e3d.jpg"]}